              <description>Determines when RX data FIFO 'tr_rx_req' trigger is activated:
- Trigger is active when RX_DATA_MMIO_FIFO_STATUS.USED &gt; TRIGGER_LEVEL.</description>
              <bitRange>[2:0]</bitRange>
