                    <field>
                      <name>LBOWAITBLITENGRESSOURCESCOUNTER</name>
                      <description>The internal counter is incremented with each 16th clock when the operation has been triggered but is waiting for BlitEng ressources. Only active in LBO and when LBOUtilizationMeasurementEn is set. This field is updated with SaveAndResetMeasurements pulse and internal counter is reset.</description>
