                  </field>
                  <field>
                    <name>MAPBIT3</name>
                    <description>map bit[ 3 ] from [ Blue, Green, Red ] or from TSig[5-0]. If MapBit3 in [ 23..0 ] =&gt; bit[ 3 ] = [ Blue, Green, Red ] [ MapBit3 ]; if MapBit3 in [29 .. 24] =&gt; bit[ 3 ] in { TSig[5] .. TSig[0] }; If MapBit3 = 31 =&gt; bit[ 3 ] = 0 ; if MapBit3= 30 =&gt;  bit[ 3 ] = 1</description>
                    <bitRange>[28:24]</bitRange>
